G3843.def:
**πάντως **
_adv._ (πάς), [in LXX: [[2Ki.5.11|4Ki.5:11]] (see Thackeray, _Gr._, 47), [[Tob.14.8|Tob.14:8]], al. ;]
**altogether, by all means**;
(a) without neg. (from Hdt. on) : [[1Co.16.12|1Co.16:12]] esp. in strong affirmations, **surely, at all events**: [[Luk.4.23|Luk.4:23]], [[Act.21.22; 28.4|Act.21:22 28:4]], [[1Co.9.10|1Co.9:10]];
(b) with neg. (so always in mom.), **in a complete negation**: [[Rom.3.9|Rom.3:9]] in a partial negation (Bl., § 75, 7), [[1Co.5.10|1Co.5:10]]†
(AS)
